### 4. Logical Relationships  

```
G1  -> G2, G3, G5  [AND][;]
G2  -> G2.1, G2.2, G2.3  [AND][;]
G2.3 -> G6, AT3  [AND][;]
G6  -> AT6, AT8  [AND][;]
G3  -> G7, G3a  [AND][;]
